WEBVTT

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:18.200
Okay, fetch!

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.780
The batter's hit it!

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:25.750
Center back! Center back!

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.280
Out!

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:29.980
Three outs, and it's game over!

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.380
The Hokkaido Tokachi B block division 
preliminaries fall baseball tournament winner

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.930
is Ooezo Agricultural High School!

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.480
The Hokkaido tournament's next.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.700
And if we win that, we secure 
a spot in the spring prelims?

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.390
Yeah.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:45.140
Oh, they're interviewing the winning team.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.870
I felt supported by my teammates' defense.

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:47.670
I see.

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:48.790
So cool!

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.290
Komaba might be the one getting 
interviewed next year.

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.740
Ezonoo Festival 
Event Planning

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:56.990
So, I want people to see 
how cool we are, too!

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.890
Should we have people watch 
us practice our usual stuff?

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:01.950
We could set it up like a competition.

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:05.540
But the only people who can jump

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:07.710
are the club president, Yoda, and Mikage.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.120
Discussing the festival event again?!

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.910
Cut it out and focus on the Freshman War!

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:16.350
Ookawa-senpai, go find a job!

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:51.850
<b>Fall Chapter Episode 3
Hachiken 
Jumps High</b>

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:49.550
Walk.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:51.940
Trot.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:53.900
Canter.

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:04.580
New members, you have all 
mastered the basics.

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:07.330
Let's try going to the next stage today.

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:11.710
It's time to try show jumping.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:14.840
Oh, wow, finally.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.760
Can we really jump this?

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.380
You need not worry.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:21.010
Trust your horse.

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.750
<i>All right!</i>

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:31.290
<i>I'll show them how cool I can be!</i>

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.310
Go, Maron!

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:36.350
<i>I can do this!</i>

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:37.650
<i>I can jump!</i>

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.180
<i>I </i>will<i> jump!</i>

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:50.070
Hey, why didn't you jump like I asked?!

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:51.220
I'm going in!

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.750
Yay! I made it!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:57.960
Whoa!

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.510
It's pretty scary, but it feels awesome!

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:02.720
Whoa!

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:04.300
Yay, I did it!

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.930
I jumped, too!

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.390
Maron, let's try this again!

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.940
<i>I </i>will<i> jump this time!</i>

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.640
Hey, why?!

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:19.550
Uh-oh.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:20.810
Two refusals.

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:22.610
If this were a competition, 
you'd be disqualified.

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:29.490
Yeah! I did it again!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.500
Yup, keep it up.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:37.070
<b>This Month's Slogan 
 Every day is a moment of truth!</b>

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:34.350
Were you able to do the last problem?

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:35.700
It was easy!

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.080
Yeah, no sweat.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.400
<i>Crap...</i>

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.910
Maron, let's give this another try!

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:47.850
Jump! Go!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.290
What's the problem?

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.100
I'm all okay on the basics, aren't I?

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.900
Mikage, can you give it a try with Maron?

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:02.230
Sure.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.010
I'm counting on you, Maron.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:25.000
He's pretty good.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.500
Well, that's because <i>you're</i> good, Mikage!

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.300
Sakae-chan, want to give him a try?

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.370
Me?

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:32.770
I wonder if it'll work...

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:33.970
Whoa.

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:35.470
I got it!

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:37.190
He's easy to ride!

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:38.230
What the...

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:39.150
Let me have another try!

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:41.340
Go!

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:42.590
This time...

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:44.900
You...

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:49.450
Do your job, Maro-Eyebrows!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.560
I think Maron's doing his job.

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:53.830
Indeed.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:00.830
Sit!

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.380
Down!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:05.180
Even a dog knows how to obey.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.470
Why can't you?

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:10.070
Man, I really tensed up.

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:12.980
I totally thought I'd fall 
at least once, but...

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:15.020
It went better than I expected.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.480
It was easier than I thought.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:18.160
Yeah!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.550
I heard world-class riders 
can jump over our heads.

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:30.580
Good job.

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:32.610
You're not going home yet?

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.580
Oh, have to finish the club journal.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:40.040
Today's Activities 
The first-years attempted show jumping. 
Kino, Maruyama, and Sakae succeeded on the first try.
 Hachiken

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:45.210
Man, why can't I jump?

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:48.040
If we make this into an 
event at the festival,

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:50.550
I have to get good at this...

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:54.030
I just know Maro-Eyebrows 
and I don't get along...

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:56.640
Can't they just put me on a different horse?

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.310
Yeah, you might be able to 
jump on a different horse.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:00.370
Right?

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.560
I knew it!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.520
But I don't think that would be good.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:05.480
Huh? Why?

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:09.950
Why does it have to be Maron? 
What do you mean by that?

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.030
{mm} I could explain, but I can't.

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:15.360
Huh?!

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:18.070
I deserve a proper explanation!

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:21.620
Ezonoo Festival 
Event Planning

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:19.810
If I explain it to you in words,

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:21.620
you'd only have a superficial understanding.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:25.040
That might be why Maron isn't jumping.

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.010
He wants you to really understand.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:28.610
Like, through experience?

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:31.630
Then I won't ever get it 
until I ride enough times!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.680
That's right...

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:36.870
I have to practice more.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:38.250
More...

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:41.980
I'll ask Nakajima-sensei  
for extra practice time.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.330
You can't!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:44.350
Why?!

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:47.320
If I suck, I have to practice 
more than the other guys!

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.440
You can't!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.870
Horses need rest, too!

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:53.500
They can become exhausted and get sick,

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:56.000
and may even need to be put down!

00:07:56.860 --> 00:07:58.970
It's not a sport you can do by yourself.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:01.370
You've gotta think about your partner, too!

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:07.040
You're both still here?

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.980
I'm going to lock up.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:11.540
Oh, okay. I'll get going.

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:15.190
Good job.

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:16.270
Thank you.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:17.420
Excuse me.

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:18.900
Good job.

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:27.270
Hachiken-kun.

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:28.980
Wh-What?!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.440
Are you free next Sunday?

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:35.150
Can I show you something?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:45.000
<b>Tokachi Shimizu Station</b>

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.120
<i>It's Mikage's hometown.</i>

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:46.410
Hey!

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:47.710
How've you been, farmhand?

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:51.160
Thank you for having me over the summer!

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.700
Dad, thanks for doing this.

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:53.550
Sure.

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:56.260
Get in. It's already started.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:02.680
<b>Kumaushi Equestrian Club</b>

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:02.680
This is the equestrian club I joined.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:07.270
They're having a friendly competition

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:09.460
with another equestrian club
today as a social event.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:11.990
Hello!

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:13.690
Oh! Aki!

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:14.450
Hi.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.200
Mikage-san, it's been a while!

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.680
Are you competing today?

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:21.210
No, I'm just here to watch today.

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:23.580
I brought a friend from 
our school's equestrian club.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.470
You should enter the competition.

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:29.540
Hey, Prez, can she jump in?

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:31.440
Why not?

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:32.440
It's okay?

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:34.380
What an easygoing competition!

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:37.380
You can borrow gear and a horse.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.770
Really? Then maybe I will, since I'm here.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:40.680
What about you?

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:42.100
Me?

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:43.990
Want to jump in?

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:51.320
No, I... can't jump, so...

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:52.830
Yay!

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:54.990
I thought Takakura-san'd 
be competing today!

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.130
What?

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:58.390
Did you come today to see Takakura-san?

00:09:58.430 --> 00:09:59.290
Yeah!

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.980
He's so exemplary.

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:01.660
<i>Takakura?</i>

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:03.010
I'm so looking forward to it!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.980
<i>Who the hell is he?</i>

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:05.200
<i>You wanted me here today 
to show him to me?!</i>

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:10.050
Wow, the rider's so tiny!

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.880
He's a second-year in junior high.

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:14.090
He's good!

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:17.980
That was Ishiyama-kun and Rosanna 
from the Kumaushi Equestrian Club.

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:21.160
Time: 43.12 seconds, no penalties.

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:23.620
Congratulations!

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:26.350
I can't let Aki-neechan 
keep beating me.

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:33.410
How long have you been riding?

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.730
Oh... About seven years.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:37.970
You're so good.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:41.620
I guess you need to have a lot of experience
 to control the horse like that.

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:44.000
I'm not all that good.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:46.410
Rosanna's amazing.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.520
Oh! Takakura-san's next!

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.420
It's Takakura-san!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:52.580
So cool!

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.370
<i>Takakura?!</i>

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:55.750
<i>What kind of guy is he?</i>

00:10:57.930 --> 00:11:01.340
Here we have Matsuzawa-san and 
Takakura from Kumaushi Equestrian Club.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.000
Takakura-san!

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.470
So amazing!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.030
Takakura-san?

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:07.810
A Hokkaido pony breed.

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:10.790
Wow, this one's tiny.

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:12.230
Can he jump?

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:14.980
No way!

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:17.020
You're so great, Takakura-san!

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:19.070
He does such great work.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:22.580
Um... Is the rider really experienced?

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:25.580
No, she's only been riding 
for a little over a year.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.740
Matsuzawa-san, Takakura-san, 
you were both great!

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:35.840
Oh, I'm so glad Takakura-san 
had a great time jumping!

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.260
Oops.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.840
That was last-minute entry 
Mikage-san and Snow March.

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:11.220
Time: 46.58 seconds, four penalties.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:13.170
Oh, too bad!

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.040
Her time was good!

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.390
Thanks, March!

00:12:17.390 --> 00:12:19.290
It must've been hard to adjust
 to a new rider so quickly,

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:21.050
but you were great!

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:24.190
The horse helped her out a lot.

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:30.180
Horseback riding is a pretty strange sport,
 if you think about it.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.360
It's coed,

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:35.650
and there aren't any categories for different 
breeds — even ponies are okay.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:37.530
I guess.

00:12:37.530 --> 00:12:41.760
Competitions at this level don't distinguish 
between gender, age, or horse breed.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.030
That makes it fun.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:45.360
I just jumped in,

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.370
but had fun thanks to the horse.

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:55.740
<i>People here always credit their horse,</i>

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:58.200
<i>no matter how experienced they are.</i>

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:08.890
You've gotta think about your partner, too!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.620
That's what's so good about 
them, dontcha think?

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:13.690
Wait...

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:15.810
Now that I think about it, Mikage...

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:16.810
Yeah?

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:19.530
Do you use your accent 
when you're being frank?

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:21.400
What?!

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:24.860
What's wrong?!

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:29.940
I went to really small schools in the mountains
 for elementary and junior high.

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:32.200
Well... I'm kind of embarrassed about it,

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.580
so I've been careful to talk like 
everyone else in high school...

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:37.060
Hey! You laughed!

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:38.530
That's mean!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.300
I didn't think that kind of thing 
ever got to you, that's all!

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:47.720
I mean, Komaba's always speaks like that!

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:50.180
But I'm embarrassed about it, okay?

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.450
Jeez!

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:53.250
It's nothing to worry about!

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:55.230
That's quite a complex you've got there!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.130
You guys seem to be having fun, eh?

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.150
<b>Kumaushi Equestrian Club</b>

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:02.150
I'll go return the equipment and clothes.

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:08.220
Are you guys dating—

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:09.620
Not at all!

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:12.920
Do you have feelings for Aki?

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.580
Actually... yes.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:17.700
You bastard!

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:20.210
Are you thinking of trying 
to get into her pants?!

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:22.920
Of course not!

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.960
You saying she's not cute enough?!

00:14:26.810 --> 00:14:28.010
<i>I'm dead meat!</i>

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:34.400
Wh-Wh-Whether I have 
feelings for her aside...

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:38.020
Um... I think she's a great person! Yeah!

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:43.500
When I got lost in Ezonoo, 
she came to find me.

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.390
She invited me to join the equestrian club.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:48.360
She cheered me up with a horseshoe charm...

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.920
She's always calm with a smile on her face.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:52.200
She's a great person!

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:55.030
And you made her mad.

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:57.440
Yes... I'm sorry!

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:59.600
I'm so sorry! I really am!

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:00.600
I'm really sorry...

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:01.900
Why are you apologizing?

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:02.630
What?

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.990
Dad, are you grilling Hachiken-kun again?

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:07.840
I'm not.

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:11.140
I was just wondering if you guys made up.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:15.460
<i>The awkwardness continues...</i>

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:19.560
By the way, is Ichirou doing okay?

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:21.610
Yeah.

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:22.910
He's trying really hard.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.820
It's almost the Hokkaido tournament, too.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.110
Hey, Vice Prez!

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.330
Here's your snack fee!

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:38.850
Oh, welcome.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:39.960
Hi!

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.120
Isn't Hachiken here?

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:45.470
No, he's not on duty today.

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:47.760
Doesn't he come take care of the

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:49.470
horses anyway, even if he isn't on duty?

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:51.300
Hmm...

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.470
Perhaps something's happened.

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:57.120
He had an argument with Mikage-san.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:00.930
Nishikawa Hajime 

00:15:57.910 --> 00:15:59.200
Hachiken?

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.930
I saw him submit a request to leave campus.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:04.430
He said he was going somewhere with Mikage.

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:05.400
With Mikage?

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:08.610
He was looking kind of serious.

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:10.700
Aki?

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.820
Isn't she visiting her family today?

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:15.490
She said she was going to Shimizu.

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:18.140
<i>An argument...</i>

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:20.150
<i>Looking serious...</i>

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:22.700
<i>Both of them visiting her family...</i>

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.580
Another improper sexual relati—

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:28.400
Horned melon.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:31.030
Also known as kiwano and hedged gourd.

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:32.380
You shouldn't hit people people with it.

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:34.900
You jerk! You chicken perv!

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:37.120
Do you have a burning desire to 
get me expelled or something?!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:38.090
I'll kill you!

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:39.220
I'll snap that beak of yours!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.100
I heard you guys had a fight!

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:45.390
We... did, but it was about club stuff!

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:47.680
Today, we just went to 
visit an equestrian club.

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.890
Right? We've already 
patched things up, right?

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:51.820
Huh? Oh, yeah! Right!

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:53.700
Oh, that's boring.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.470
The hatchet kabocha.

00:16:56.470 --> 00:17:00.080
A kabocha so hard that it takes a 
cleaver or a hatchet to split it open.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.040
You shouldn't hit people people with it.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.160
Don't cause a ruckus in the hallway!

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:05.520
Sorry.

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:06.290
Really sorry.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.250
Oh, right. I have to 
report in that I'm back!

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:11.420
Man, Tokiwa's never gonna change...

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.340
Yeah.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.640
<b>Hachiken 
Yuugo</b>

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:18.990
I forgot I was on cleaning duty!

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:21.500
Crap! I'll get bathroom 
cleaning as punishment!

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.230
I did it for you.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.050
Huh?

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.980
You weren't here, so I did 
the cleaning for you.

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:28.410
Beppu-sama...

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:31.990
You did it when I had Pork 
Bowl, too. Thanks as always.

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:34.320
This time, I want you to sub in twice.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:36.640
One weeks' worth of snacks works, too.

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:38.310
I'll go broke.

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.600
<i>When you think about it...</i>

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:47.710
<i>When you live in a dorm,</i>

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.770
<i>people just cover for you.</i>

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:05.780
<i>I laughed at Mikage for having 
a complex about her accent,</i>

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:09.230
<i>but I need to do something about this, too.</i>

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:13.860
<i>It'll be okay.</i>

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:16.180
<i>Things are different now.</i>

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:18.820
<i>I'm not alone!</i>

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:20.990
Maron...

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:24.260
I can't jump by myself,

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:25.520
so please cover me!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.580
Going in!

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:47.150
He's not gonna trust me right away...

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:47.150
Hachiken-kun!

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:48.830
Keep yourself close to Maron's back!

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:51.040
Huh?

00:18:58.140 --> 00:18:58.910
Whoa!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:01.850
Hachiken-kun!

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:06.690
Are you okay?!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:07.620
Idiot!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:09.560
Don't let go of the reins when you fall off!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:10.620
You'll get your head stepped on!

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:13.220
Did you see how high they just jumped?

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:15.630
I had no idea horses could jump so high...

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:28.220
So Senpai and Mikage always get 
to see that kind of view...

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:29.440
Huh?

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.620
Did you hit your head or something?

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:32.980
No...

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:37.220
Maro...

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.480
Wow!

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:42.360
You're an amazing horse!

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:44.790
Horseback riding may appear to be a

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:45.280
Maro, you're amazing!

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:47.580
sport in which the rider 
maneuvers the horse at will,

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.780
but it's actually very dependent 
on the horse's own ability.

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:51.620
Maro!

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:54.840
Some people say the horse is 
doing 70 percent of the job.

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:58.940
The horse covers for his rider 
and leads him to the goal,

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:03.780
so we need to trust the horse 
and try to let the horse run

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:04.800
as freely as he can.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:09.310
Now that he has realized this for himself

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.310
and risked his own neck 
to gain Maro's trust,

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.140
I'm sure their bond has strengthened.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:17.360
But since you fell off your 
horse, you are disqualified.

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:21.680
Oh, wow.

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:23.150
That was a nasty spill.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:24.600
Go wash up.

00:20:24.810 --> 00:20:26.090
Ookawa-senpai.

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:26.760
Yeah?

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:29.120
When you talked about the 
job search earlier,

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:32.740
you were trying to tell me not 
to make the horse adjust to me

00:20:32.740 --> 00:20:34.390
but to adjust myself to the horse.

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:36.840
I'm sorry it took me so long to 
realize what you were getting at.

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:40.670
Huh, when did I make a 
grand speech like that?

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:42.230
Oh, man...

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:45.520
I don't care what job I get, 
as long as I get <i>a</i> job!

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:48.430
Then I can finally slack 
off until I graduate.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.680
Why can't I land a job?!

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:52.310
I wanna be slacking!

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:54.120
Perhaps companies don't trust you

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:54.570
I just wanna have fun!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.770
because that attitude is 
apparent at your interviews.

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:02.510
<i>I still don't know if I like horses, either.</i>

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:06.180
<i>They're big, smelly, and hard to handle...</i>

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:11.580
<i>But they let me see things in a way
 I've never seen them before.</i>

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:14.420
That's really cool!

